+<li><a href="gosafe.html">6. Global Safe Exploration of Dynamical Systems: GoSafe &amp; GoSafeOpt</a> — <a href="gosafe.html#book-lab">application and review</a></li>
+<li><a href="viability.html">7. Viability &amp; Safe Value Functions</a> — <a href="viability.html#book-lab">application and review</a></li>
+</ul>
